prompt:
Create an original 1536×1024 true-transparent RGBA sprite sheet for JAMVERSE '96. Use the supplied Leo gameplay sprite only as an identity and pixel-art style reference. Draw exactly five distinct complete full-body Leo poses in a strict three-column by two-row grid, row-major; leave the sixth cell fully transparent. Broad gutters and outer margins; each complete figure stays in its own cell with hair, hands and shoes clear. Consistent camera, scale and ground baseline. Readable 1990s arcade pixel-art clusters and dark outlines.

